# Advanced Topics

## Cross-References

A link like this one pointing at [Setup](#setup) only resolves if a heading named Setup exists somewhere in the Publication. If it does not, the build refuses to produce any output at all until the Structure Violation is fixed.

## Table of Contents

EPUB output needs exactly one chapter whose front matter marks it as the table-of-contents source, which is what the Introduction chapter does.

See [Introduction](#introduction) to start over from the beginning.
